# vi mode corner cases: multi-digit motion counts, EOF inside commands,
# redo of dd/cc/yy, replace-mode editing keys, negative counts through the
# API, and functions bound to unexpected keys.
tags: vi
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
set keyseq-timeout 50
--- script
readline "> "

=== d12l-multi-digit-motion-count
tags: vi-delete-to numarg
keys: abcdefghijklmnopq\e<pause>0d12l<dump>\r

=== 2d3l-multiplied-counts
tags: vi-delete-to numarg
keys: abcdefghijklmnopq\e<pause>02d3l<dump>\r

=== d-count-then-non-motion
tags: vi-delete-to numarg
keys: one two\e<pause>0d2z<dump>\r

=== d-count-then-eof
tags: vi-delete-to eof
keys: one two\e<pause>0d2

=== d-then-eof
tags: vi-delete-to eof
keys: one two\e<pause>0d

=== f-then-eof
tags: vi-char-search eof
keys: one two\e<pause>0f

=== r-then-eof
tags: vi-change-char eof
keys: one two\e<pause>0r

=== dd-redo
tags: vi-delete-to vi-redo
keys: one two\e<pause>dd<pause>u<dump>.<dump>\r

=== cc-redo
tags: vi-change-to vi-redo
keys: one\e<pause>ccX\e<pause>.<dump>\r

=== yy-redo
tags: vi-yank-to vi-redo
keys: abc\e<pause>yy.P<dump>\r

=== yw-redo
tags: vi-yank-to vi-redo
keys: one two\e<pause>0yw.P<dump>\r

=== cf-failed-dings
tags: vi-change-to vi-char-search
keys: one two\e<pause>0cfz<dump>\r

=== yf-failed-dings
tags: vi-yank-to vi-char-search
keys: one two\e<pause>0yfz<dump>\r

=== replace-mode-ctrl-u
tags: vi-replace unix-line-discard
keys: abcdef\e<pause>0lRXYZ\C-u<dump>\e\r

=== replace-mode-ctrl-w
tags: vi-replace vi-unix-word-rubout
keys: abc def\e<pause>0RX YZ\C-w<dump>\e\r

=== replace-mode-ctrl-y
tags: vi-replace yank
keys: abc def\e<pause>0dwi\e<pause>Rxx\C-y<dump>\e<pause>\C-?<dump>\r

=== replace-mode-bracketed-paste
tags: vi-replace bracketed-paste
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
set keyseq-timeout 50
set enable-bracketed-paste on
--- keys
abcdef\e<pause>0R<paste-start>XYZ<paste-end><dump>\e<pause><dump>\r

=== replace-mode-bracketed-paste-empty
tags: vi-replace bracketed-paste
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
set keyseq-timeout 50
set enable-bracketed-paste on
--- keys
abcdef\e<pause>0R<paste-start><paste-end><dump>\e\r

=== replace-mode-rubout-past-start
tags: vi-replace vi-overstrike-delete
keys: abcdef\e<pause>0lRX\C-?\C-?<dump>\e\r

=== redo-replace-mode
tags: vi-replace vi-redo
keys: abcdefgh\e<pause>0RXY\e<pause>ll.<dump>\r

=== redo-replace-mode-with-count
tags: vi-replace vi-redo numarg
keys: abcdefgh\e<pause>0RX\e<pause>l3.<dump>\r

=== vi-search-other-key-dings
tags: vi-search
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
set keyseq-timeout 50
set keymap vi-command
"Q": vi-search
--- keys
abc\e<pause>Q<dump>\r

=== vi-complete-other-key
tags: vi-complete completion
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
set keyseq-timeout 50
set keymap vi-command
"Q": vi-complete
--- script
complete_words alpha beta
set rl_completion_entry_function words
readline "> "
--- keys
al\e<pause>Q<dump>\r

=== vi-complete-mid-word
tags: vi-complete completion
--- script
complete_words alphabet beta
set rl_completion_entry_function words
readline "> "
--- keys
alp x\e<pause>0\\<dump>\r

=== vi-complete-star
tags: vi-complete completion
--- script
complete_words alpha alps beta
set rl_completion_entry_function words
readline "> "
--- keys
al\e<pause>*<dump>\r

=== vi-complete-equals
tags: vi-complete completion display
--- script
complete_words alpha alps beta
set rl_completion_entry_function words
readline "> "
--- keys
al\e<pause>=<snap>\r

=== api-negative-counts
tags: api vi-prev-word vi-next-word vi-end-word vi-delete vi-rubout
--- script
def n
rl_vi_prev_word -1 0
dump
rl_vi_next_word -1 0
dump
rl_vi_end_word -1 0
dump
rl_vi_delete -1 0
dump
rl_vi_rubout -1 0
dump
end
defun negs n
rl_bind_keyseq_in_map "\C-xn" negs vi-command
readline "> "
--- keys
one two three\e<pause>bl\C-xn\r

=== api-rubout-count-beyond-start
tags: api vi-rubout
--- script
def n
rl_vi_rubout 9 0
dump
end
defun rub n
rl_bind_keyseq_in_map "\C-xn" rub vi-insert
readline "> "
--- keys
abc\C-xn\r

=== api-vi-prev-word-at-start-dings
tags: api vi-prev-word
--- script
def n
rl_vi_prev_word 1 0
dump
end
defun pw n
rl_bind_keyseq_in_map "\C-xn" pw vi-command
readline "> "
--- keys
abc\e<pause>0\C-xn\r

=== X-at-start-dings
tags: vi-rubout
keys: abc\e<pause>0X<dump>\r

=== x-on-empty-line-dings
tags: vi-delete
keys: \e<pause>x<dump>\r

=== 3X-rubout-count
tags: vi-rubout numarg
keys: abcdef\e<pause>3X<dump>\r

=== tilde-on-non-letters
tags: vi-change-case
keys: a1-b\e<pause>04~<dump>\r

=== tilde-on-empty-line
tags: vi-change-case
keys: \e<pause>~<dump>\r

=== percent-no-bracket-dings
tags: vi-match
keys: abc def\e<pause>0%<dump>\r

=== percent-unbalanced-dings
tags: vi-match
keys: ((abc\e<pause>0%<dump>\r

=== percent-backward-unbalanced-dings
tags: vi-match
keys: abc))\e<pause>%<dump>\r

=== semicolon-after-failed-search
tags: vi-char-search
keys: abc\e<pause>0fz;<dump>\r

=== zero-after-count-is-digit
tags: vi-arg-digit numarg
keys: abcdefghijklmnop\e<pause>010l<dump>\r

=== universal-argument-in-motion
tags: universal-argument vi-delete-to
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
set keyseq-timeout 50
set keymap vi-command
"\C-u": universal-argument
--- keys
abcdefghijklmnop\e<pause>0d2\C-ul<dump>\r
